# A new world through the menus under --climate-jump 100, plan 004 phase 07: its first tick owes weeks 12 to 25, so the census
# screen comes up at once, and under --headless the session works the whole census out in the next tick. At 640 by 480, scale 2,
# with the menus' places as week.script has them. The pointer starts in the middle, at 320, 240.

1 move 0 -40                    # 320, 200: Singleplayer
+1 button left down
+1 button left up
+1 move 132 196                 # 452, 396: Create New World
+1 button left down
+1 button left up
+1 key w down
+1 key w up
+1 key e down
+1 key e up
+1 key k down
+1 key k up
+1 move -132 -194               # 320, 202: the seed field
+1 button left down
+1 button left up
+1 key 7 down
+1 key 7 up
+1 key enter down               # opens the world, between this tick and the next
+1 key enter up

+40 screenshot census.png       # the census screen with its report, over the stopped world
+1 move 0 242                   # 320, 444: Continue, at 212 to 232 of the screen's 240
+1 button left down
+1 button left up
+20 screenshot after.png        # playing again
+1 end
